    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>HEALING SOUL UNLIVING-ZOMBIE</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 12</p>\n<p>The fall of living prey briefly quiets the endless hunger burning inside your corpse.</p>\n<p>When you reduce a living creature to 0 HP with your Bite or Slam, you regain HP equal to your level plus your Constitution modifier, minimum 1. You can gain this healing once per round.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: felling a living creature with Grave Bite or Corpse Slam heals you your level + Constitution modifier (minimum 1), once a round.</p>",
